<title>NETHERLANDS: ERIKS FIRST-HALF NET PROFIT UNCHANGED.</title>
<headline>ERIKS FIRST-HALF NET PROFIT UNCHANGED.</headline>
<dateline>ALKMAAR, Netherlands 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     6.40 vs   6.39</p>
<p>    Net profit			    11.2  vs  same</p>
<p>    Turnover			     232.3  vs 215.6</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    16.9  vs  16.7</p>
<p>    Interest gains			 0.5  vs   1.2</p>
<p>    Tax					6.0  vs   6.5</p>
<p>    Minorities charge		    0.2  vs   same</p>
<p>NOTE - Technical wholesaler Eriks Holding NV said in March</p>
<p>it expected further growth of turnover and profits in 1996.</p>
</text>
